            <ArticleTitle>[Comparison of the effects of bepridil and diltiazem in Prinzmetal's angina. Crossed, randomized, double-blind study. Apropos of 14 cases].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>167-72</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The efficacy of bepridil was compared with that of diltiazem in treatment of Prinzmetal's angina, in a crossed, randomized double-blind study of 14 observations using repeated Holter recordings (a total of 9 for each patient). Clinical and electrical monitoring showed that the efficacy of bepridil is comparable to that of diltiazem in treatment of spastic angina.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
